=== Parse number token
12
---
Number  1:1-1:3  0..2  "12"

=== Parse number token with leading whitespace
    12
---
Number  1:5-1:7  4..6  "12"

=== Parse double quote and single quote string tokens
  "Hello" 'world'  
---
String  1:3-1:10   2..9    "\"Hello\""
String  1:11-1:18  10..17  "'world'"

=== Parse string token with internal whitespace
  " Hello "  
---
String  1:3-1:12  2..11  "\" Hello \""

=== Parse boolean tokens
 true false 
---
BooleanTrue   1:2-1:6   1..5   "true"
BooleanFalse  1:7-1:12  6..11  "false"

=== Parse nil token
 nil 
---
Nil  1:2-1:5  1..4  "nil"
